  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Aladdin** (1 review): After an intro, Aladdin runs straight into a tune called El Ron on disc 1 [2]\n- **Chameleon** (1 review): Chameleon segues directly into Reverb, with no break between the two [2]\n- **Jesus Children of America** (1 review): Jesus Children of America flows without a pause into Stay [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Chameleon**: back after 34 archived shows (526 days) [3]\n- **JCA**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Flurries**: back after 37 archived shows (575 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2004-12-12.mk012.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 135 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2004-12-12.mk012.shnf**: taped by Adam McCullough; source: mk012 > UA5 > Nomad Jukebox 3 > xact > Sound Studio > shntool [1]",
